{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-arrays","title":"内存布局与数组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/performance/memory-arrays","wordCount":1167,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存布局与数组\">内存布局与数组</h1><p>类型推断都过关了,代码却还是慢——这时凶手通常在内存:数据在缓存里排得不对,或热循环每轮都偷偷分配一个临时数组。Julia 在编译层面追平了 C,但常数因子的胜负仍由内存布局决定。本篇讲清 Julia 数组在内存里长什么样、遍历顺序为何重要、如何避免不必要的分配,以及把小数组搬上栈的利器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>编译层面追平 C 之后,常数因子的胜负由内存决定。四个概念是这一层的抓手:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>列优先(column-major)</strong>:同一列元素在内存相邻、跨列跳跃,遍历时须让第一个下标在最内层变化,才能连续命中缓存。</li>\n<li><strong>视图 vs 拷贝</strong>:切片默认拷贝并分配,<code>@view</code>/<code>@views</code> 返回共享内存的 <code>SubArray</code>,消除热循环分配。</li>\n<li><strong>就地广播</strong>:<code>.=</code> 把结果写回预分配数组,整条表达式融合成单循环、零临时数组。</li>\n<li><strong>小数组上栈</strong>:<code>StaticArrays</code> 把尺寸编进类型,让定长小数组在栈上运算、完全内联。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>关键操作</th>\n<th>收益</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>列优先布局</td>\n<td>内层走第一下标</td>\n<td>连续访问,用满缓存行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>视图</td>\n<td><code>@view</code> / <code>@views</code></td>\n<td>零分配,共享底层内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>就地广播</td>\n<td><code>y .= f.(x)</code></td>\n<td>融合成单循环,稳态零分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈上小数组</td>\n<td><code>SVector</code>/<code>SMatrix</code></td>\n<td>不碰堆,运算编译期展开</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「分配多少」不靠猜:用 <code>@time</code>、<code>@allocated</code>、<code>BenchmarkTools</code> 量化,热循环的目标是稳态零分配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"列优先-julia-数组的内存真相\">列优先:Julia 数组的内存真相</h2><p>Julia 的多维数组是列优先(column-major)存储,和 Fortran、MATLAB 一致,与 C、NumPy 默认的行优先相反。这意味着同一列的元素在内存里相邻,跨列则跳跃。一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m \\times n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵 <code>A</code> 中元素 <code>A[i,j]</code> 的线性偏移是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(j-1) \\cdot m + (i-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;矩阵 A 2x3&lt;br/&gt;1 3 5&lt;br/&gt;2 4 6&quot;] --&gt; B[列优先线性排布]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;内存顺序: 1,2,3,4,5,6&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[同列相邻&lt;br/&gt;跨列跳 m 个元素]&#10;  D --&gt; E[遍历应外层 j、内层 i&lt;br/&gt;才连续命中缓存]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"矩阵 A 2x3&lt;br/&gt;1 3 5&lt;br/&gt;2 4 6\"] --&gt; B[列优先线性排布]\n  B --&gt; C[\"内存顺序: 1,2,3,4,5,6\"]\n  C --&gt; D[同列相邻&lt;br/&gt;跨列跳 m 个元素]\n  D --&gt; E[遍历应外层 j、内层 i&lt;br/&gt;才连续命中缓存]</pre><p>实践后果:嵌套循环必须让最内层走「列方向」(第一个下标变化最快),才能顺着内存连续访问、用满 CPU 缓存行。下面两段逻辑相同,速度可能差几倍:</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"# 慢:内层遍历行,跨列跳跃,缓存不友好&#10;function sum_bad(A)&#10;    s = zero(eltype(A))&#10;    for i in axes(A, 1), j in axes(A, 2)   # i 在外、j 在内 -&gt; 跨列&#10;        s += A[i, j]&#10;    end&#10;    s&#10;end&#10;&#10;# 快:内层遍历列(第一下标),连续访问内存&#10;function sum_good(A)&#10;    s = zero(eltype(A))&#10;    for j in axes(A, 2), i in axes(A, 1)   # j 在外、i 在内 -&gt; 顺列&#10;        s += A[i, j]&#10;    end&#10;    s&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 慢:内层遍历行,跨列跳跃,缓存不友好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function sum_bad(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s = zero(eltype(A))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in axes(A, 1), j in axes(A, 2)   # i 在外、j 在内 -> 跨列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        s += A[i, j]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 快:内层遍历列(第一下标),连续访问内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function sum_good(A)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s = zero(eltype(A))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for j in axes(A, 2), i in axes(A, 1)   # j 在外、i 在内 -> 顺列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        s += A[i, j]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里用 <code>zero(eltype(A))</code> 而非 <code>0</code>,正是为了类型稳定,呼应 <a href=\"type-stability\">类型稳定性</a> 的初值规则——内存与类型两条性能主线在此交汇。</p>\n<h2 id=\"视图-vs-拷贝-切片的隐藏成本\">视图 vs 拷贝:切片的隐藏成本</h2><p>默认情况下,<code>A[:, 1]</code> 这样的切片会<strong>拷贝</strong>出一个新数组,在热循环里反复切片就是反复分配。<code>@view</code> 宏(或 <code>@views</code> 作用于整块代码)返回一个不拷贝、共享底层内存的 <code>SubArray</code>,消除分配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"A = rand(1000, 1000)&#10;&#10;col = A[:, 1]          # 拷贝,分配 1000 个 Float64&#10;col = @view A[:, 1]    # 视图,零分配,与 A 共享内存&#10;&#10;@views function process(A)     # 整个函数体内的切片都变视图&#10;    A[:, 1] .+= A[:, 2]&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>A = rand(1000, 1000)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>col = A[:, 1]          # 拷贝,分配 1000 个 Float64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>col = @view A[:, 1]    # 视图,零分配,与 A 共享内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@views function process(A)     # 整个函数体内的切片都变视图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    A[:, 1] .+= A[:, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>end</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>是否分配</th>\n<th>是否共享内存</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>A[:, 1]</code></td>\n<td>是(拷贝)</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>需要独立副本,后续会改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@view A[:, 1]</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>只读或就地改,在循环里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>copy(A)</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>显式深拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>reshape(A, ...)</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>改变形状但不动数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"用工具量化分配\">用工具量化分配</h2><p>「分配多少」不靠猜,用 <code>@time</code> 看分配字节数,用 <code>@benchmark</code>(来自 <code>BenchmarkTools.jl</code>)做严谨基准,用 <code>@allocated</code> 精确测一段代码的分配量。热循环的理想目标是稳态零分配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using BenchmarkTools&#10;&#10;@benchmark sum_good($A)      # 报告时间、内存、分配次数;$ 插值避免全局变量开销&#10;@allocated sum_good(A)       # 返回分配的字节数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using BenchmarkTools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@benchmark sum_good($A)      # 报告时间、内存、分配次数;$ 插值避免全局变量开销</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@allocated sum_good(A)       # 返回分配的字节数</span></span></code></pre></div><p>广播配合就地写入是消除分配的主力。回顾 <a href=\"../foundations/syntax-basics\">语法基础</a> 里的点广播:<code>y .= f.(x)</code> 用 <code>.=</code> 就地写入预分配的 <code>y</code>,整条表达式融合成单循环、零临时数组;而 <code>y = f.(x)</code> 会新分配。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"y = similar(x)        # 预分配一次&#10;y .= x .^ 2 .+ 1      # 就地、融合、零分配地反复使用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>y = similar(x)        # 预分配一次</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>y .= x .^ 2 .+ 1      # 就地、融合、零分配地反复使用</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"staticarrays-把小数组搬上栈\">StaticArrays:把小数组搬上栈</h2><p>堆分配的数组带指针、带长度、要 GC 管理。对于尺寸编译期已知的小数组(如 3D 几何里的 3 维向量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 旋转矩阵),<code>StaticArrays.jl</code> 提供 <code>SVector</code>/<code>SMatrix</code>,它们的尺寸编进类型、整体放在栈上,运算被完全展开和内联,完全不碰堆。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"julia\" data-code=\"using StaticArrays&#10;&#10;v = SVector(1.0, 2.0, 3.0)      # 尺寸进类型:SVector{3, Float64}&#10;M = @SMatrix [1.0 0.0; 0.0 1.0]&#10;w = M * v[SVector(1,2)]          # 编译期展开,无堆分配\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>using StaticArrays</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>v = SVector(1.0, 2.0, 3.0)      # 尺寸进类型:SVector{3, Float64}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>M = @SMatrix [1.0 0.0; 0.0 1.0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>w = M * v[SVector(1,2)]          # 编译期展开,无堆分配</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数组类型</th>\n<th>存储位置</th>\n<th>尺寸已知性</th>\n<th>最佳场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Array</code>/<code>Vector</code></td>\n<td>堆</td>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>大数组、尺寸动态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SVector</code>/<code>SMatrix</code></td>\n<td>栈</td>\n<td>编译期(进类型)</td>\n<td>小且定长,如几何/物理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MVector</code>/<code>MMatrix</code></td>\n<td>栈/可变</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>小定长但需就地修改</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>SVector{3,Float64}</code> 把长度 3 编进类型参数,正是 <a href=\"../foundations/type-system-dispatch\">类型系统与多重派发</a> 中参数化类型的极致运用——编译器因此能把整个向量运算展开成几条标量指令。在 <a href=\"../applications/scientific-computing\">科学计算与 SciML</a> 的微分方程求解中,用 <code>SVector</code> 表示状态向量是常见的提速手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Julia 数组列优先存储,嵌套循环须让第一个下标在最内层变化,才连续命中缓存。</li>\n<li>切片默认拷贝并分配,<code>@view</code>/<code>@views</code> 返回共享内存的视图,消除热循环里的分配。</li>\n<li>用 <code>@time</code>/<code>@allocated</code>/<code>BenchmarkTools</code> 量化分配,热循环目标是稳态零分配;<code>.=</code> 就地广播是主力手段。</li>\n<li><code>StaticArrays</code> 把编译期已知尺寸的小数组放上栈、运算内联展开,适合几何与物理中的定长向量矩阵。</li>\n<li>内存与类型稳定两条性能主线相互交织:正确的初值、参数化类型同时服务于二者。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存布局与数组","id":"内存布局与数组"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"列优先:Julia 数组的内存真相","id":"列优先-julia-数组的内存真相"},{"level":2,"text":"视图 vs 拷贝:切片的隐藏成本","id":"视图-vs-拷贝-切片的隐藏成本"},{"level":2,"text":"用工具量化分配","id":"用工具量化分配"},{"level":2,"text":"StaticArrays:把小数组搬上栈","id":"staticarrays-把小数组搬上栈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类型稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/performance/type-stability"},"next":{"title":"包管理 Pkg 与环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/julia-scientific/ecosystem/package-manager-pkg"}}